# kmotion-panel.hal: run by gladevcp itself (its -H option, see a config's EMBED_TAB_COMMAND;
# kmotion-panel.py, its -u handler, makes the hold-allowed pin and greys Back/Forward by it)
# once the panel's pins exist - gmoccapy's POSTGUI_HALFILE runs before the embedded panel is
# up. Nets the panel's buttons (kmotion-panel.ui) to kmotion-motion: KMotionCNC's Back/Forward
# in feed hold (while held, at hold-rate of the programmed speed), Measure (the geo correction
# grid, [KMOTION] MEASURE_FILE) and Geo reload (GEO_FILE)
net hold-reverse kmotion-panel.hold-reverse => kmotion.hold-reverse
net hold-forward kmotion-panel.hold-forward => kmotion.hold-forward
net measure kmotion-panel.measure => kmotion.measure
net geo-reload kmotion-panel.geo-reload => kmotion.geo-reload
net hold-allowed kmotion.hold-allowed => kmotion-panel.hold-allowed
setp kmotion.hold-rate 0.2
